<b>Shigeki!</b>

20:14.790 --> 20:16.900
<b>Why are you here?</b>

20:16.900 --> 20:18.530
<b>Umm... I...</b>

20:19.360 --> 20:22.300
<b>...didn’t know your league match was today.</b>

20:22.300 --> 20:24.030
<b>And because of yesterday...</b>

20:24.030 --> 20:27.200
<b>Umm... how was your shogi match?</b>

20:30.240 --> 20:31.570
<b>I lost.</b>

20:31.570 --> 20:33.210
<b>Shigeki!</b>

20:35.780 --> 20:38.410
<b>I’m sorry... I’m sorry...</b>

20:38.410 --> 20:41.720
<b>I said those strange things on the day
before your important match...</b>

20:41.720 --> 20:45.390
<b>I made you feel bad,
and because of me...</b>

20:45.390 --> 20:47.190
<b>Don’t belittle yourself.</b>

20:48.320 --> 20:50.890
<b>No matter how much one may be
troubled over someone’s words...</b>

20:50.890 --> 20:52.860
<b>No matter how disrupted one’s heart may become...</b>

20:53.400 --> 20:55.330
<b>Winning... losing...</b>

20:56.570 --> 20:59.030
<b>In the end,
one only has himself to blame.</b>

20:59.030 --> 21:02.100
<b>I didn’t lose because of you.</b>

21:07.080 --> 21:13.010
<b>Until yesterday, I thought this might be
my first and last chance of going pro.</b>

21:13.020 --> 21:17.180
<b>I thought this chance would come only once
in a hundred years, and had come for me.</b>

21:17.190 --> 21:19.190
<b>That’s how I thought about it.</b>

21:19.190 --> 21:21.720
<b>Because my goal was to become a pro.</b>

21:21.720 --> 21:24.490
<b>But I was wrong.</b>

21:24.490 --> 21:25.530
<b>I don’t understand...</b>

21:26.160 --> 21:28.460
<b>I want...</b>

21:28.460 --> 21:33.100
<b>...to play more shogi the way I am today.</b>

21:33.100 --> 21:35.100
<b>I want to properly approach myself as I did today.</b>

21:36.100 --> 21:41.040
<b>I realized today that this was the
true meaning of becoming a pro.</b>

21:41.040 --> 21:42.380
<b>I don’t get you at all!</b>

21:44.680 --> 21:48.920
<b>Yeah... you might not understand.</b>

21:48.920 --> 21:50.350
<b>It’s not something
you need to understand.</b>

21:54.690 --> 21:55.620
<b>Let’s head back.</b>

21:55.620 --> 21:56.460
<b>No...</b>

21:56.460 --> 21:59.230
<b>Go back... ahead of me...</b>

22:08.570 --> 22:10.670
<b><i>“To the me of a year from today.”</i></b>

22:09.170 --> 22:12.140
<b>To the me of a year from today.</b>

22:09.170 --> 22:12.140
<b>Me</b>

22:09.170 --> 22:12.140
<b>Compose Mail</b>

22:12.910 --> 22:14.110
<b><i>“How are you?”</i></b>

22:14.880 --> 22:18.080
<b><i>“I’ll be seventeen soon.”</i></b>

22:18.080 --> 22:21.750
<b><i>“I met up with Shigeki yesterday, but I forgot to tell him.”</i></b>

22:21.750 --> 22:24.120
<b><i>“I’m sure he won’t remember...”</i></b>

22:26.090 --> 22:29.560
<b><i>“But I’m not alone this year.”</i></b>

22:29.560 --> 22:31.860
<b><i>“Because Bun-chan will celebrate with me.”</i></b>

22:31.860 --> 22:37.770
<b>Because Bun-chan will
celebrate with me.
I'm alone
but not all alone</b>

22:32.490 --> 22:34.030
<b><i>“I’m alone...”</i></b>

22:35.760 --> 22:37.770
<b><i>“...but not all alone.”</i></b>

22:43.710 --> 22:44.570
<b>Shall we go home, then?</b>

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
Daremo shiranai kotoba de kimi he to

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
On that nostalgic hill, I sang out to you

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
Utaikaketa natsukashii oka de

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
words that no one else knew.

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
Tomare soyokaze kawaranu omoide

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
The dying breeze and my unchanged memories

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
Sotto misete ano koro no boku wa

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
gently reveal to me what I was like back then.

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Aa yume wo aishite hitori ni natta

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Ah, I thought that being alone

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
Sore de ii to omotta

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
and cherishing my dream would be fine.

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
Haruka na sora ni wa ima mo kimi ga iru darou

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
I wonder if you’re still there right now in the distant sky?

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Yasashiku ikiru yo afureru namida koraeta

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Now I lead a simple life, having suppressed my overflowing tears.

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
Mirai no melody ga shizuka ni yureru kisetsu

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
The melody of the future is in the quietly stirring seasons.

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
Aitai na itsu no hi ka... mattete

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
I want to see you again, and I’m waiting for that day.

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
Aitai ne boku wa mada humming boy

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
I want to see you again, but I’m still a humming boy.

