24:42.220 --> 24:44.060
<b>The world of games is very severe.</b>

24:44.060 --> 24:47.530
<b>Even if you know you’ve lost, you must
not forget to keep your poker face.</b>

24:47.530 --> 24:49.230
<b>Is that how it is?</b>

24:49.230 --> 24:50.660
<b>Indeed.</b>

